{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axol's Quest is a short, turn-based RPG about an axolotl on an epic quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029480/extras/99894889a9cace0119d0f8af8620c3ab.poster.avif?t=1759526400\" width=665 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029480/extras/99894889a9cace0119d0f8af8620c3ab.webm?t=1759526400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an open-ended world!</strong> The Land of Xochimilco is a tropical paradise full of secrets to uncover and silly characters to meet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork makes the dream work!</strong>\u00a0Every character combo in the party has a unique team attack to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles Abound!</strong> Move barrels, jump on geysers, break rocks, and more to progress through Xochimilco's perilous dungeons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a fun and lighthearted adventure!</strong>\u00a0Partake in a simple, endearing story you can see through beginning to end in one afternoon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight turn-based combat!</strong> Each party member has a specific niche in battle and you'll need to strategize to achieve perfect synergy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Beyond Expectations!</strong>\u00a0Nothing is as it seems in the world of Axol's Quest... Prepare yourself for twists, turns, trials, and even tribulations! And be sure to collect all 15 peanuts in the land and shoot for the stars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roughly 1-hour Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Axol's Quest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/7771c2418cab0ca7df90a916afff1ee402202a92.jpg"},{"name":"Barnacle Blast It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/91108f0457d3ff6c3153e062000e1d6d175c5961.jpg"},{"name":"A Full House!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/782bd9703659a9a37235df3adcf8100168887f8c.jpg"},{"name":"Doggie Dog World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/7c14a445e95fc9846b012fdce7cb307b3ee744a2.jpg"},{"name":"Teeney Tested and Certified!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/d7c5219dc5249c7ddd79099da040c3327fa5cc3b.jpg"},{"name":"Brothers In Arms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/d6073d862da6db6c16cff2c441d34c60b57ed698.jpg"},{"name":"Xee of Xtars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029480/c5df16c1fa0d11b62bca1f7a346d9aa33327d197.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029480?t=1759526400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029480/ef8b0650abba8d656521f1be52f92455ebaa5af6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759526400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029480/ff3d46d2433428fe7c9de95d55f9bc442b6e2a95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759526400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029480/ff3d46d2433428fe7c9de95d55f9bc442b6e2a95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759526400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse O